	
	http://localhost:9091/actuator/health
Shows application "UP" or "DOWN" status.

	http://localhost:9091/actuator/metrics
List of available metrics (memory, cpu, etc.).

	http://localhost:9091/actuator/env
Shows the current Spring Environment properties.

	http://localhost:9091/actuator/loggers
Allows you to view and change log levels at runtime.